@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Saúde e readiness
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Listar produtos ativos
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Consultar produto individual (inclui produtos inativos)
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Consultar preços em lote
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

{
  "productIds": [
    "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222"
  ]
}
